From: Eren Makal <69559506+erenmakal@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 21:22:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Initialize advanced network config during bootstrap

Load the advanced network configuration immediately after Canvas' global
configuration during Minecraft bootstrap. This prevents the first inbound
Netty connection from lazily triggering YAML parsing/file creation on a
Netty I/O thread.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/Bootstrap.java b/net/minecraft/server/Bootstrap.java
--- a/net/minecraft/server/Bootstrap.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/Bootstrap.java
@@ -49,6 +49,7 @@ public class Bootstrap {
                 throw new IllegalStateException("Unable to load registries");
             }
 
             io.canvasmc.canvas.GlobalConfiguration.init(); // Canvas - Rebrand - load global configuration
+            io.canvasmc.canvas.network.NetworkOptimizationsConfiguration.init(); // Canvas - load advanced network config during bootstrap
             FireBlock.bootStrap();
             ComposterBlock.bootStrap();
             if (EntityType.getKey(EntityTypes.PLAYER) == null) {
